---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Manifesto | Practical Humanism">
	<article class="manifesto-wrapper">
		<header class="manifesto-header reveal">
			<h1>Manifesto</h1>
		</header>
		
		<div class="manifesto-content reveal">
			<blockquote class="lead-quote">
				"Man is a transitional being, he is not final; for in him and high beyond him ascend the radiant degrees which climb to a divine supermanhood." 
				<cite>— Sri Aurobindo</cite>
			</blockquote>

			<div class="text-block">
				<p>
					I stand where the Ageless Wisdom intersects with the exactitudes of modern logic. 
					What I term <strong>Practical Humanism</strong> is a definite, pragmatic Method for the deliberate unfolding of human potential. 
					I recognize that the present human form is not an ultimate completion, but an intermediate stage.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="sigil-anchor">
				<svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
					<path d="M12 2C7.58 2 4 5.58 4 10C4 12.3 5.05 14.36 6.7 15.75L7.2 16.2C7.2 16.2 7 16.8 7 17.5V19C7 20.1 7.9 21 9 21H15C16.1 21 17 20.1 17 19V17.5C17 16.8 16.8 16.2 16.8 16.2L17.3 15.75C18.95 14.36 20 12.3 20 10C20 5.58 16.42 2 12 2ZM9 12C8.17 12 7.5 11.33 7.5 10.5C7.5 9.67 8.17 9 9 9C9.83 9 10.5 9.67 10.5 10.5C10.5 11.33 9.83 12 9 12ZM12 15L11 13H13L12 15ZM15 12C14.17 12 13.5 11.33 13.5 10.5C13.5 9.67 14.17 9 15 9C15.83 9 16.5 9.67 16.5 10.5C16.5 11.33 15.83 12 15 12ZM10 18H11V19H10V18ZM11.5 18H12.5V19H11.5V18ZM13 18H14V19H13V18Z" />
				</svg>
			</div>

			<div class="text-block">
				<p>
					I cast aside nothing of the ancient tools; rather, I adapt them to present necessities. 
					By applying these traditional instruments with a strictly practical, testing attitude, 
					I aim to awaken the dormant centers of the personality.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-block closing">
				<p>
					The ultimate aim is to make of my own vehicle a living laboratory of evolution. 
					The Work demands the balanced development of the entire being: 
					the purification of the mind, the direction of the Will, 
					and the conscious realization of the Indwelling Spirit.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<footer class="reveal">
			<hr />
		</footer>
	</article>

	<script>
		const observerOptions = { threshold: 0.1 };
		const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
			entries.forEach(entry => {
				if (entry.isIntersecting) {
					entry.target.classList.add('active');
				}
			});
		}, observerOptions);

		document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
	</script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.manifesto-wrapper {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
	}

	.manifesto-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 5rem;
	}

	.manifesto-header h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 10vw, 3.5rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.5em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 300;
		margin: 0;
		margin-right: -0.5em;
		color: var(--text-color);
	}

	.manifesto-content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.lead-quote {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--accent-muted);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
		border: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.lead-quote cite {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-style: normal;
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		opacity: 0.6;
	}

	.text-block {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--text-color);
		opacity: 0.9;
		max-width: 100%;
	}

	.text-block strong {
		color: var(--accent-color);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.sigil-anchor {
		color: var(--accent-color);
		opacity: 0.6;
		margin: 2rem 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.closing {
		font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--accent-color);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line-color);
		padding-top: 3rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	footer hr {
		margin-top: 6rem;
		opacity: 0.1;
		border: none;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--text-color);
	}

	/* Reveal Animation */
	.reveal {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(30px);
		transition: all 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
	}
	.reveal.active {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(0);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.manifesto-wrapper {
			padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		}
		.manifesto-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}
		.manifesto-header h1 {
			letter-spacing: 0.3em;
			margin-right: -0.3em;
		}
		.lead-quote {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
		.text-block {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
		}
		.closing {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
